      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a successfully percutaneous closure of a brisk coronary artery rupture with a custom-made \"vein graft stent,\" a Palmaz-Schatz stent covered with a vein graft. This method is an elegant and effective alternative to the traditional surgical approach and should be considered whenever technically and clinically feasible."},
